This is a Go port of parts of SpeexDSP 1.2.1 (https://github.com/xiph/speexdsp,
tag SpeexDSP-1.2.1, commit 1b28a0f61bc31162979e1f26f3981fc3637095c8):

- echo, internal/mdf: libspeexdsp/mdf.c, the echo canceller
  (Copyright (C) 2003-2008 Jean-Marc Valin).
- internal/fft: libspeexdsp/smallft.c (FFTPACK via Ogg Vorbis,
  (C) 1994-2001 XIPHOPHORUS Company) and the USE_SMALLFT path of
  libspeexdsp/fftwrap.c (Copyright (C) 2005-2006 Jean-Marc Valin).

internal/room follows talkie-core's simulated room (from wonky-talkie's
EchoRoom).

Each ported file keeps its upstream copyright notice. SpeexDSP's COPYING is
retained in third_party/licenses/speexdsp-COPYING.txt. Third-party terms,
including test fixtures, are listed in THIRD_PARTY.md. Not affiliated with
or endorsed by Xiph.org.
